<h3>Webhook configuration</h3><p>Callback URL: <code><?=e(url('/webhooks/wise'))?></code><br>Event: <code>balances#update</code><br>Schema: <code>4.0.0</code></p><p>Create the profile-level subscription using the access Wise makes available for your account, then enter its ID above. Wise test callbacks may fail until the subscription ID is saved and the receiver enabled; retry the test afterwards. Every accepted event must have a valid Wise RSA signature and match the configured profile and subscription. Test events never confirm payments.</p>
<p>Webhook events enter a private review queue. Automated matching and receipts remain inactive until your real account access and reconciliation rules are verified. Local transfers, conversions and other credits must not be mistaken for contributions.</p>
